# My Sandbox

Here is a summary of [ongoing projects](/sandbox/ryang/)

# Multilayer with variable density

[multilayer_varydensity/bar.c](): a modified version of [/test/bar.c](/src/test/bar.c) with constant density.

[multilayer_varydensity/horn_Boussinesq.c](): a modified version of [/test/horn.c](/src/test/horn.c), with the density affecting only the buoyancy term.

[multilayer_varydensity/horn_fulleq.c](): a modified version of [/test/horn.c](/src/test/horn.c), with the density affecting the full equation.

[multilayer_varydensity/flat.c](): a modified version of [/test/horn.c](/src/test/horn.c) without tilt.

[multilayer_varydensity/dispersion.c](): a modified version of [/test/dispersion.c](/src/test/dispersion.c) without tilt.

[multilayer_varydensity/stokes.c](): a modified version of [/test/stokes.c](/src/test/stokes.c) with variable density.

[multilayer_varydensity/shear_varyvis.c](): shear flow with two layers of fluid with variable density and viscosity.

# Breaking wave with surfactant

[surfactant/wave.c](): a modified version of [wave.c](/sandbox/popinet/wave.c) and surfactant transportation from [farsoiya/marangoni_surfactant/](/sandbox/farsoiya/marangoni_surfactant/).